WEBVTT

00:11.880 --> 00:13.490
The time has come!

00:14.070 --> 00:16.370
The Food Fight Festival...

00:16.370 --> 00:19.000
Starts now!

00:16.490 --> 00:19.370
(Food Fight Festival)

00:19.990 --> 00:22.370
The hype levels are crazy.

00:22.930 --> 00:26.840
Teams of up to ten
will compete in five rounds.

00:26.840 --> 00:29.180
Teams are free to
swap participants for each round.

00:29.180 --> 00:32.570
The team with the highest
total score at the end wins!

00:32.570 --> 00:34.260
What's going on with these visuals?!

00:34.680 --> 00:40.050
Just figured people'd appreciate some
spicy footage of me over boring walls of text.

00:40.050 --> 00:41.680
- Fanservice is best service?
- Fanservice is best service!

00:41.680 --> 00:42.890
Don't gimme that crap!

00:43.180 --> 00:45.170
There, there.

00:47.720 --> 00:52.280
This FFF could help Kurumi,
who's not used to dealing with people,

00:52.660 --> 00:55.780
break the ice with the gang
by working with them.

00:56.460 --> 00:58.240
I'll make sure it happens!

01:12.760 --> 01:17.970
(The 100 Girlfriends Who Really, Really,
Really, Really, REALLY Love You)

01:18.800 --> 01:21.640
(Karane
as the Tsundere Princess)

01:21.640 --> 01:23.930
(Demonstration
Tea-Time Prep)

01:23.930 --> 01:25.520
(Hakari
Suggestive Weight-Loss Running)

01:25.520 --> 01:26.770
(Kurumi
Ate all of the school store's bread)

01:26.770 --> 01:28.270
(Mimimi
(Getting ready) Two hours later)

01:29.440 --> 01:31.980
(Nano
Robot that exercises for her)

01:31.980 --> 01:34.400
(Shizuka
Has 365 book recommendations this week)

01:34.400 --> 01:36.700
(Kusuri
Has newly developed drug
that gives you sweet dreams)

01:36.700 --> 01:37.360
(Hahari
Chairperson's Address "Education" and "Love")

01:37.360 --> 01:38.030
(Iku
Has been doing push-ups since yesterday)

01:38.030 --> 01:39.570
(Meme
Customized Plushy- Rentaro-kun)

01:39.700 --> 01:44.410
(Rentaro-kun Appreciation Opening)

01:47.170 --> 01:48.830
(Meme-san added ears
and a tail for you!)

01:54.460 --> 01:56.509
(Rentaro-kun (& Others) Appreciation Opening)

02:29.540 --> 02:32.829
Let's get right into the qualifiers!

02:32.829 --> 02:35.700
The food you will eat for this round is...

02:35.700 --> 02:37.010
Rice!

02:37.010 --> 02:39.490
There's a whole array of
side dishes available to eat,

02:39.490 --> 02:41.260
but they won't count toward the total!

02:41.340 --> 02:45.140
(Rice:)

02:41.690 --> 02:45.140
The name of the game is eating
as much rice as you can!

02:45.550 --> 02:48.210
It'd be inefficient to fill
your belly with side dishes.

02:48.210 --> 02:50.520
So the key's strikin' a balance, eh?

02:50.520 --> 02:53.360
Okay, everyone eat a whole buncha rice!

02:53.360 --> 02:56.150
But that'd mean we'd all be
full after the qualifiers.

02:56.570 --> 02:59.150
I'm entering every single round.

02:59.420 --> 03:03.030
I can win solo. It doesn't
really matter if you join me or not.

03:03.410 --> 03:05.500
Are you saying we're useless?

03:05.500 --> 03:07.210
Don't hit her! Hit me instead!

03:07.210 --> 03:08.910
I'm not mad enough
to throw hands!

03:08.920 --> 03:11.080
Just how short-tempered
do you think I am?!

03:12.190 --> 03:16.090
I want her to work with the rest
of the gang, but let's start slow.

03:17.180 --> 03:18.460
I'll take this one.

03:18.460 --> 03:19.590
Ready?

03:19.590 --> 03:21.090
Start the qualifiers!

03:21.360 --> 03:23.390
Let's dig in, Kurumi.

03:23.390 --> 03:25.760
I'm the most familiar to her right now.

03:25.760 --> 03:26.220
Huh?

03:26.579 --> 03:29.310
Barbecue... pork cutlets!

03:29.640 --> 03:31.190
You haven't taken one bite yet!

03:31.190 --> 03:34.690
I-I know, I know! Here I go.

03:40.420 --> 03:42.850
Go ahead and have the sides, Kurumi.

03:42.850 --> 03:44.990
Wha? Are you out of...

03:44.990 --> 03:46.410
your mind?!

03:46.410 --> 03:48.660
Appetite over logic, huh?

03:48.660 --> 03:52.410
This... won't... stop me...

03:52.690 --> 03:55.920
Now, Kurumi-chan, either eat or speak.

03:52.920 --> 03:55.920
(Not her mom,
but acting like it)

03:56.980 --> 03:58.170
You chose to eat, huh?!

04:00.690 --> 04:02.890
She's eating sides right off the bat?

04:02.890 --> 04:03.890
Is she stupid?

04:03.890 --> 04:05.050
Does she know the rules?

04:05.050 --> 04:08.560
Who called her stupid? Name yourself!
I know you're over there!

04:08.560 --> 04:11.540
- Calm down, Rentaro-kun!
- You're not getting off until you apologize!

04:11.550 --> 04:13.060
- Oh... ooh!
- What's wrong? Cat got your tongue?!

04:15.080 --> 04:18.010
But seriously, what are you thinking?

04:18.010 --> 04:19.779
Just watch Kurumi. You'll get it.

04:19.779 --> 04:21.070
Get what, exactly...

04:21.940 --> 04:24.950
(Beaming ♥)

04:21.940 --> 04:23.810
Yummy!

04:23.810 --> 04:24.950
Whomst?!

04:24.950 --> 04:26.820
Yum...

04:26.820 --> 04:28.450
She makes it...

04:28.450 --> 04:30.410
She makes it look so good.

04:30.410 --> 04:34.560
S-Sides would make the rice
go down easier, huh?

04:38.730 --> 04:41.670
No way. Was this part of your plan?

04:41.670 --> 04:43.050
Yep.

04:43.050 --> 04:44.170
More, please.

04:44.170 --> 04:45.490
Aye, here you are.

04:45.490 --> 04:48.800
Kurumi will burn through
that extra food fast,

04:49.250 --> 04:51.120
so it won't affect her much.

04:51.870 --> 04:54.450
It will, however, fill up our rivals.

04:54.450 --> 04:55.310
More, please.

04:55.310 --> 04:57.130
Here, Rentaro-chan.

04:57.130 --> 04:59.730
So, even if they eat the same amount,

04:59.730 --> 05:02.340
Kurumi will have more space left over.

05:02.340 --> 05:03.320
More, please.

05:03.630 --> 05:05.150
As you wish, sire.

05:05.150 --> 05:06.090
Thanks!

05:07.030 --> 05:11.120
She'll pull ahead of all the others!

05:12.280 --> 05:13.200
More, please.

05:13.200 --> 05:16.040
And how are you inhaling all that rice?!

05:16.380 --> 05:18.020
You should be sick of it.

05:18.020 --> 05:19.670
Please don't push yourself.

05:19.950 --> 05:22.420
If anything, I can't get enough of it.

05:22.860 --> 05:26.800
You're taking turns serving me this rice.
It should all be the same,

05:27.200 --> 05:29.160
but it all tastes so different.

05:31.190 --> 05:33.710
Hakari flavored, Karane flavored,

05:33.710 --> 05:36.270
Shizuka-chan flavored, Nano flavored,

05:36.270 --> 05:39.070
Kusuri-senpai flavored,
and Hahari-san flavored rice...

05:39.800 --> 05:42.970
They all taste different
and delicious in their own way!

05:42.970 --> 05:47.070
The man was a fully dedicated
girlfriend-loving monster.

05:48.320 --> 05:50.820
(Hngh!!! ♥ ♥ ♥)

05:49.070 --> 05:50.820
The feelings were mutual.

05:50.820 --> 05:54.080
Whoa! Rice is yum, yum is rice!

05:54.080 --> 05:56.080
Yummy!

05:56.080 --> 05:57.780
Yummy rice!

05:57.780 --> 05:59.330
What the heck? That's freaky.

05:59.330 --> 06:00.690
They're monsters!

06:01.480 --> 06:05.090
We've got monsters raiding this festival!

06:05.090 --> 06:08.250
Time's up!

06:08.250 --> 06:10.590
I'm going with bread over rice
for the next year.

06:10.590 --> 06:13.720
We'll now announce the qualifying
teams in ascending order!

06:13.720 --> 06:15.720
(Tallying)

06:14.250 --> 06:15.650
In third place...

06:15.650 --> 06:17.350
The Rentaro Family team!

06:15.720 --> 06:17.350
(3rd Place
Rentaro Family)

06:17.350 --> 06:18.220
Heck yeah!

06:18.220 --> 06:22.190
No fanfare for the main characters!
Are you guys really okay with that?!

06:22.190 --> 06:22.580
In second place is

06:22.580 --> 06:23.680
- Highly efficient.
In second place is

06:23.680 --> 06:24.060
- You did great, Kurumi-chan.
In second place is

06:24.060 --> 06:25.630
- You did great, Kurumi-chan.
- a team of five adult women,

06:25.630 --> 06:27.240
- Hands off! Go away!
- a team of five adult women,

06:27.240 --> 06:28.990
(2nd Place
Gorilla Syndicate)

06:27.240 --> 06:28.990
the Gorilla Syndicate team!

06:28.990 --> 06:33.240
That special gelato is for Yuu-kun and I
to spoonfeed each other, ook!

06:33.240 --> 06:36.370
Ook, ook!

06:36.370 --> 06:40.170
And in first place is a solo competitor!

06:39.750 --> 06:40.250
(2nd Place
Gorilla Syndicate)

06:40.250 --> 06:40.750
(1st Place
Chankonomnishiki)

06:40.250 --> 06:40.750
1st Place
Chankonomnishiki

06:41.380 --> 06:43.890
Chankonomnishiki!

06:42.250 --> 06:47.630
(Delish)

06:43.890 --> 06:47.050
He's got the kinda size that wouldn't
look out of place in ONE PIECE.

06:47.050 --> 06:47.630
Who?

06:47.630 --> 06:50.380
Food fighting yokozuna, Chankonomnishiki.

06:50.700 --> 06:52.440
Champion prizefighter of eating contests.

06:52.440 --> 06:53.260
What?!

06:53.260 --> 06:57.000
The character design's changed from the manga,
but maybe the voice actor's the same?

06:57.000 --> 06:58.640
The manga doesn't have voice acting!

06:58.640 --> 07:00.110
Nice to meat you.

07:00.110 --> 07:01.650
Bro's got the TTS voice going!

07:02.000 --> 07:04.350
It's time for the main rounds!

07:04.350 --> 07:07.530
The Food Fight Festival begins
with an eating contest classic!

07:07.530 --> 07:09.530
The food for the first round is...

07:09.800 --> 07:12.530
A classic? What will it be?

07:12.530 --> 07:15.280
Bubble tea!

07:15.280 --> 07:17.290
Bubble tea? A classic?

07:17.900 --> 07:19.850
Who's entering round one—

07:20.700 --> 07:24.540
You two did really well in the qualifiers.
Take a rest, okay?

07:24.910 --> 07:27.550
Like I said, I'm entering every round.

07:27.550 --> 07:31.520
Not even you can handle every round.
Let the others take it—

07:31.520 --> 07:32.300
Buzz off!

07:32.850 --> 07:34.800
What can they even do?

07:34.800 --> 07:36.110
They look like they can barely eat.

07:36.110 --> 07:38.540
- I guess it depends on what the other teams do.
They look like they can barely eat.

07:38.540 --> 07:40.250
It would be prudent to wait and see.

07:40.250 --> 07:41.440
Very well.

07:42.250 --> 07:43.610
Then I'll join the fray.

07:43.940 --> 07:46.520
(Food Fight Festival)

07:44.360 --> 07:46.520
Round one...

07:46.520 --> 07:47.770
Go!

07:47.770 --> 07:49.520
Nice to tea you.

07:49.900 --> 07:51.530
Yummy!

07:53.420 --> 07:54.780
- Nice to tea you. - Ook!
- More, please!

07:57.280 --> 07:58.790
(Ten Minutes Later)

07:58.790 --> 08:00.770
- Nice to tea you.
- Chanko's running up a sizable lead!

08:00.770 --> 08:01.960
- Chanko's running up a sizable lead!

08:01.960 --> 08:04.840
The Gorilla Syndicate and
the Rentaro Family are giving chase,

08:04.840 --> 08:06.540
but are they having a hard time?

08:07.570 --> 08:09.920
My jaw hurts!

08:09.920 --> 08:14.680
These high-quality tapioca balls
are so chewy, they're wearing my jaw out.

08:14.680 --> 08:16.820
This round isn't about the tummy.

08:16.820 --> 08:18.680
It's a jaw endurance contest!

08:27.310 --> 08:29.700
H-How is Shizuka fine?

08:29.700 --> 08:32.530
Shizuka-chan...
has the tiniest widdle mouth!

08:32.530 --> 08:33.570
So what?!

08:33.890 --> 08:36.610
If each of her bites are tiny...

08:36.610 --> 08:39.539
...she has to chew more
to eat the same amount of food.

08:39.539 --> 08:44.080
So her jaw, multiple times
more used to chewing than most...

08:45.160 --> 08:48.600
...is perfectly trained
for this sort of challenge?

08:46.330 --> 08:48.960
(omnomomnomomnom) (om nom)

08:49.430 --> 08:50.960
Basically, Shizuka-chan is...

08:51.440 --> 08:52.970
Yeah, Shizuka-chan is...

08:52.970 --> 08:56.970
(omnomomnomomnom)

08:52.970 --> 08:56.610
...cute like a smol floof friend!

08:56.970 --> 09:00.970
(Round One Results
Chankonomnishiki (3 pts)
2nd - Rentaro Family (2 pts)
3rd - Gorilla Syndicate (1 pt))

08:56.970 --> 08:59.420
And that's it for round one!

08:59.420 --> 09:00.970
In round two, we have...

09:00.970 --> 09:03.850
a ten-piece sushi speed-eating race!

09:04.170 --> 09:06.860
I'm confident in my speed and efficiency.

09:06.860 --> 09:08.610
S-Same here!

09:09.110 --> 09:10.980
Round two...

09:11.410 --> 09:12.480
Go!

09:16.920 --> 09:18.540
Yummy!

09:18.540 --> 09:20.900
You don't have time to savor it, Kurumi!

09:21.980 --> 09:24.410
I get that, but...

09:24.410 --> 09:27.440
Eating food without savoring it
is sacrilege!

09:27.440 --> 09:29.610
Whoa, Chanko's so fast!

09:29.610 --> 09:31.820
Will he finish first with ease?

09:31.820 --> 09:32.550
No!

09:32.840 --> 09:35.420
Unlike the others, Eiai's keeping up!

09:35.420 --> 09:37.460
Way to go, Nano!

09:37.460 --> 09:38.930
Wait, look.

09:38.930 --> 09:40.160
Is she even chewing?

09:41.380 --> 09:43.180
Mastication is inefficient.

09:43.180 --> 09:45.560
(*Do NOT try this at home unless
your esophagus is made of special alloy)

09:43.360 --> 09:45.560
Is your esophagus made of special alloy?!

09:47.310 --> 09:50.420
While the Gorilla Syndicate
and Haraga are slowing down,

09:50.420 --> 09:54.190
Eiai and Chanko are reaching
for their tenth sushi!

09:54.750 --> 09:56.880
Who will finish first?!

09:59.140 --> 10:01.370
Chanko finishes first!

10:01.370 --> 10:02.450
Nice to eat you.

10:02.960 --> 10:04.200
What's wrong, Nano?

10:04.580 --> 10:06.700
I ate too much. I'm about to vomit.

10:06.460 --> 10:08.080
(Stomach capacity varies
from person to person)

10:06.700 --> 10:08.080
From just nine sushi?!

10:08.590 --> 10:10.740
The Gorilla Syndicate team is catching up!

10:10.740 --> 10:13.710
Six sushi, seven... And now the eighth!

10:13.710 --> 10:15.000
I'm left with no choice.

10:16.210 --> 10:18.720
Where are you going
with that sushi, Nano?!

10:19.140 --> 10:23.650
When an animal is in mortal danger,
its survival instincts activate,

10:23.650 --> 10:26.980
and it can consume surplus food
to ensure its future.

10:27.300 --> 10:28.230
And...

10:32.690 --> 10:35.930
This situation is unquestionably...
life-threatening.

10:37.990 --> 10:41.020
I see! Nano's afraid of heights!

10:41.020 --> 10:42.240
You see what?!

10:42.710 --> 10:44.990
I'm terrified,

10:45.420 --> 10:49.030
but I must pass this torch
as it was passed to me!

10:49.820 --> 10:51.720
She's so high up!

10:51.720 --> 10:54.300
Her beautiful long hair,
glistening in the light...

10:54.300 --> 10:56.690
Plus she's a real beauty.

10:56.690 --> 10:58.010
You know what she looks like?

10:59.150 --> 11:01.510
Rapunzel upon the tower!

11:03.180 --> 11:06.770
E... Eiai has finished the race!

11:07.810 --> 11:08.520
I...

11:08.830 --> 11:09.850
I can't get down.

11:09.850 --> 11:11.020
Nano!

11:11.020 --> 11:13.520
I'm coming for you!

11:15.020 --> 11:18.280
Damn it! Not our Rapunzel!

11:18.280 --> 11:20.650
(Round Two Results
1st - Chankonomnishiki (6 pts)
2nd - Rentaro Family (4 pts)
3rd - Gorilla Syndicate (2 pt))

11:18.280 --> 11:20.650
Hope you explode in happiness!

11:20.650 --> 11:23.660
Round three was super spicy mapo tofu.

11:24.170 --> 11:28.650
The Rentaro Family sent out Karane,
who boasted about her spice tolerance, Kusuri,

11:28.650 --> 11:30.910
and Kurumi yet again.

11:31.230 --> 11:33.450
The unbelievable levels of heat

11:33.450 --> 11:34.170
had the participants gasping for air.

11:34.170 --> 11:35.420
(Won't stand for this blasphemy
against the food gods
(ceded the round))

11:34.170 --> 11:35.420
- No thanks for the eat.
had the participants gasping for air.

11:35.420 --> 11:37.670
(Is surprisingly okay with spice
(thanks to her potion tolerance))

11:36.340 --> 11:39.540
In the end, things happened
and the Rentaro Family won.

11:37.670 --> 11:39.920
(gobble gobble)

11:39.920 --> 11:43.930
(Round Three Results
1st - Rentaro Family (7 pts)
2nd - Gorilla Syndicate (4 pts)
3rd - Chankonomnishiki (7 pt))

11:40.300 --> 11:42.660
Read the manga for the spicy details.

11:42.660 --> 11:43.930
The "died between cuts" treatment!

11:43.930 --> 11:46.720
(Death Between Cuts
When a character's death is
revealed via narration, and not shown.
Is often used in period dramas
and canceled manga.)

11:43.930 --> 11:46.720
Adverse effect of limited runtime!

11:46.720 --> 11:48.970
Round four's theme is cake!

11:48.970 --> 11:52.770
Each team is upping the pace
compared to round three!

11:52.770 --> 11:54.600
Yummy!

11:54.600 --> 11:55.860
(jolt!!)

11:56.020 --> 11:59.360
(smiiirk♥)

11:59.360 --> 12:00.750
Let me have cake.

12:00.750 --> 12:03.210
Unsurprisingly, Chanko's leading the pack!

12:03.210 --> 12:05.540
But the Gorilla Syndicate
are showing their pluck!

12:05.540 --> 12:07.120
We can't lose this, ook!

12:09.060 --> 12:11.370
This is so much sugar, though.

12:11.650 --> 12:14.220
This can't be good, weight-wise.

12:14.220 --> 12:17.380
A psychological attack
that's super effective on girls!

12:17.790 --> 12:18.890
True...

12:18.890 --> 12:20.550
Friendly fire!

12:20.550 --> 12:22.730
I've been putting it on lately.

12:23.300 --> 12:25.170
Urk, me too...

12:25.170 --> 12:26.300
And self-immolation.

12:27.300 --> 12:29.430
A horrific tragedy.

12:29.730 --> 12:31.930
What are those idiots doing?!

12:31.930 --> 12:34.560
Fat can go to the chest too!

12:36.590 --> 12:39.550
I can up my bust size
and seduce Rentaro-chan!

12:39.550 --> 12:42.650
We could get down and dirty!

12:43.820 --> 12:45.070
(Round Four Results
1st - Chankonomnishiki (10 pts)
2nd - Rentaro Family (9 pts)
3rd - Gorilla Syndicate (5 pts))

12:44.450 --> 12:46.440
Great job, everyone!

12:45.070 --> 12:49.080
(rub rub ♥)

12:46.440 --> 12:49.080
You're all so cute and can
hold your own in eating contests!

12:49.080 --> 12:54.080
(rub rub ♥)

12:49.080 --> 12:52.110
I have such multitalented girlfriends!

12:52.110 --> 12:54.080
How are these people doing it?

12:54.080 --> 12:55.330
(rub rub ♥)

12:54.080 --> 12:57.330
How could you eat all that, ook?

12:57.600 --> 12:59.570
How hard are you coping?

12:59.570 --> 13:04.010
We're not coping.
We're one for all, and all for one.

13:04.010 --> 13:06.470
That means we're more
than the sum of our parts.

13:06.910 --> 13:07.720
In other words...

13:08.170 --> 13:09.630
It's the power of love!

13:09.300 --> 13:10.970
(booyah!!)

13:09.630 --> 13:10.970
Exactly!

13:11.300 --> 13:13.730
Wha... What in the world
are they on about?

13:13.730 --> 13:18.020
It's time for the final round!
Please take the stage, participants!

13:16.730 --> 13:22.980
(rub rub rub rub)

13:18.020 --> 13:22.130
How long are you gonna keep rubbing them?
The final round's about to begin.

13:22.130 --> 13:22.980
Uh...

13:22.980 --> 13:24.740
I have to keep it up,

13:24.740 --> 13:29.490
(rub rub)

13:25.060 --> 13:27.490
or we'll all throw up.

13:27.490 --> 13:29.490
So you were coping!

13:29.490 --> 13:33.400
By the way, my tummy will feel better
when theirs feel better.

13:30.490 --> 13:35.000
(Wants him to rub
down under, too)

13:33.400 --> 13:35.000
How does that even work?

13:35.290 --> 13:37.550
P-Power of love...

13:37.550 --> 13:40.300
Our girlfriends are in danger
of becoming hurlfriends!

13:40.300 --> 13:42.000
What'll happen in Part B?!

13:42.570 --> 13:45.010
The final round features
the eating contest classic...

13:45.010 --> 13:46.510
Ramen!

13:46.510 --> 13:51.080
Chanko's atop the standings right now,
but the final round is for double the points!

13:51.080 --> 13:52.510
It's still anybody's game!

13:52.510 --> 13:54.280
Anybody can win!

13:54.280 --> 13:56.030
So sorry, Kurumi.

13:56.030 --> 13:59.900
I was never counting on your help, anyway.

13:59.900 --> 14:02.700
Let the final round begin!

14:05.400 --> 14:07.400
Yummy!

14:07.400 --> 14:09.280
Nice to wheat you.

14:09.280 --> 14:14.100
Haraga and Chanko have been in every round,
but they show no signs of slowing down!

14:14.100 --> 14:14.890
Meanwhile...

14:14.890 --> 14:17.970
entering each round with the full team's
caught up to the Gorilla Syndicate.

14:17.970 --> 14:23.380
Only their alpha—I mean, only their captain
is in the final, and she's struggling!

14:23.920 --> 14:25.310
Captain...

14:25.310 --> 14:26.300
Captain...

14:26.670 --> 14:31.310
You louts. Thank you for
sticking with me all this while.

14:31.310 --> 14:36.560
I'll show everyone what we—
what the Gorilla Syndicate is made of, ook!

14:35.060 --> 14:36.560
(bam)

14:36.560 --> 14:38.050
Ook, captain!

14:38.050 --> 14:40.190
Alpha!

14:39.480 --> 14:40.190
(hngh ♥)

14:40.190 --> 14:42.290
We'll fight with you too, ook!

14:42.290 --> 14:44.220
Together till we die, ook!

14:44.220 --> 14:45.890
The sub gorillas are back in action!

14:45.890 --> 14:49.200
Registered members can join
in the middle of rounds, no problem!

14:49.470 --> 14:51.200
Y-You louts...

14:54.220 --> 14:55.410
Ook!

14:55.410 --> 14:58.920
Let's give everyone a taste
of the Gorilla Syndicate's fighting spirit!

14:55.660 --> 14:57.120
(Gorilla Syndicate
Fighting Spirit)

14:58.920 --> 15:01.210
Ook!

15:10.380 --> 15:13.040
Thanks for everything, Yuu-kun.

15:13.040 --> 15:14.600
Captain!

15:14.600 --> 15:18.600
It's down to a one-on-one featuring
Chanko and the Rentaro Family!

15:18.600 --> 15:20.600
They're both on their tenth bowls,

15:20.600 --> 15:22.350
but neither is breaking a sweat!

15:22.350 --> 15:24.350
Of course.

15:24.350 --> 15:27.460
After all, I haven't eaten
a single thing so far.

15:27.870 --> 15:32.520
Little did anyone know, but half of
Chankonomnishiki's face was a facade.

15:32.520 --> 15:36.540
Hidden underneath the kimono
was a giant hose and tank.

15:36.540 --> 15:40.370
He only pretended to eat and instead
spat everything into the hose.

15:38.370 --> 15:40.370
(What is this, a cartoon from the 80s?) (This whole setup's a
big fat set up!) (Cancel this show!) (That's DIRTY) (Some BS)

15:40.370 --> 15:43.040
You eat a lot for a pipsqueak.

15:43.040 --> 15:46.540
But if you think I'm letting that prize go,
there's no chanko!

15:46.860 --> 15:48.170
- Nice to wheat you.
- More, please.

15:48.170 --> 15:52.680
They both asked for their 11th bowl!
How long can they keep this up?!

15:54.130 --> 15:56.670
Sixteen bowls... seventeen...

15:56.670 --> 15:59.930
Twenty... twenty-one... twenty-two!

16:01.180 --> 16:05.590
Whoa! Haraga's hesitating!

16:06.620 --> 16:09.690
Good fight, but you're done,
Haraga-chanko.

16:09.690 --> 16:12.140
It was pointless of you
to enter every round.

16:12.140 --> 16:16.570
You messed up by eating
so much and not leaving room.

16:16.960 --> 16:18.120
Oh yeah?

16:18.610 --> 16:20.750
I know that already!

16:21.170 --> 16:22.500
All of them...

16:22.970 --> 16:27.000
They ate so much more
than I ever expected!

16:29.000 --> 16:33.900
I should've let them handle some
rounds like Rentaro-senpai said.

16:34.260 --> 16:37.810
I should have trusted them!

16:38.760 --> 16:43.640
Instead, I sat there as they ate to win,

16:43.980 --> 16:46.520
when I didn't need to be there!

16:48.180 --> 16:50.440
If I hadn't eaten so pointlessly,

16:50.780 --> 16:55.780
I could've had so many more bowls
of this delicious ramen!

16:58.280 --> 17:00.290
More, please!

17:01.240 --> 17:03.040
Wh-Why?

17:03.040 --> 17:05.099
The rules allow it.

17:05.099 --> 17:06.750
Leave the rest to us!

17:06.750 --> 17:10.880
Not what I mean!
I said so many mean things to you all!

17:10.880 --> 17:14.510
Hmph! It doesn't matter what you think!

17:14.510 --> 17:18.510
To us, you're a friend
who went to battle with us.

17:18.510 --> 17:23.890
Your presence by my side
helped me face the fear.

17:24.210 --> 17:27.520
You made us want to
stand by you, so we did.

17:27.520 --> 17:30.400
That's what mothers do!

17:33.540 --> 17:35.480
What you did wasn't
pointless at all, Kurumi.

17:36.490 --> 17:39.980
This whole time,
you've been fighting with us.

17:40.620 --> 17:42.790
That's the power of love!

17:43.240 --> 17:46.540
Teamwork? Love?

17:46.830 --> 17:49.640
Those are meaningless
in an eating contest!

17:51.110 --> 17:54.890
The old me would've dismissed
their words that way.

17:55.290 --> 17:57.800
But now I know that
they're not meaningless.

17:58.760 --> 17:59.800
After all,

18:00.190 --> 18:04.120
them being here is making me
want to fight again!

18:04.560 --> 18:08.000
Whoa, Haraga's back in action!

18:08.440 --> 18:13.320
Hmph, it's too late for a bunch of
nobodies to make a difference.

18:14.190 --> 18:19.230
The efforts of the Rentaro Family
so far finally bore fruit.

18:19.230 --> 18:25.080
All the food that he'd consumed to
beat them filled his tank to the brim.

18:26.790 --> 18:28.330
If that's how it's gonna be...

18:28.330 --> 18:32.210
time for the last resort!

18:38.770 --> 18:41.100
Chanko has transformed!

18:41.100 --> 18:42.350
So creepy—Ahem!

18:42.350 --> 18:44.650
What's the plan here?!

18:44.650 --> 18:45.600
I still...

18:46.010 --> 18:48.100
I still have my own stomach!

18:48.100 --> 18:50.600
But there's no chanko they aren't full!

18:50.600 --> 18:53.360
We're running out of time.

18:53.360 --> 18:56.760
Which team will emerge victorious
and take the crown?!

19:02.150 --> 19:04.970
Both teams are down, with the scores tied!

19:04.970 --> 19:06.240
The bodies are piling up!

19:09.210 --> 19:12.750
What's this? Haraga and Chanko are moving!

19:12.750 --> 19:16.750
Will whoever takes the next bite win?!

19:17.540 --> 19:21.010
I can't take any more... but...

19:21.500 --> 19:24.510
I want all of us to win together!

19:29.310 --> 19:30.520
...please.

19:30.830 --> 19:33.470
Wha? No way!

19:33.470 --> 19:36.020
Please. Do this for me,

19:36.400 --> 19:39.240
and I'll let you taste
whatever you want later.

19:39.780 --> 19:41.240
Five seconds left!

19:41.640 --> 19:42.320
Five,

19:42.320 --> 19:43.450
four,

19:43.450 --> 19:44.450
three,

19:44.450 --> 19:45.310
two,

19:45.310 --> 19:45.580
- S...
two,

19:45.580 --> 19:46.200
- S...
- one!

19:46.200 --> 19:47.450
Say aah.

19:47.450 --> 19:49.080
Aah.

19:50.450 --> 19:52.710
Time's up!

19:59.540 --> 20:01.720
Wh-What are the chankos...

20:02.030 --> 20:05.450
You shouldn't have been
able to swallow that!

20:05.450 --> 20:08.120
Yeah, any other time,
I would've thrown up.

20:09.000 --> 20:12.480
But I could never throw up anything
my girlfriend feeds me.

20:13.730 --> 20:15.740
I would rather die!

20:15.740 --> 20:19.560
The Rentaro Family team wins!

20:24.400 --> 20:27.120
Delicious gelato, yumma mia!

20:27.120 --> 20:28.340
Yum!

20:28.340 --> 20:30.070
- Rum. Rum.
Yum!

20:34.010 --> 20:37.130
I want to apologize to you all.

20:37.410 --> 20:41.590
I was so rude to you all...

21:07.170 --> 21:10.350
What's up, Kurumi?
Why'd you wanna see me alone?

21:13.240 --> 21:14.320
Thanks.

21:15.490 --> 21:19.300
Thanks for inviting me to the contest.
It helped me break the ice with the gang.

21:19.300 --> 21:23.800
Uh, I guess too many cooks
didn't spoil the broth.

21:23.800 --> 21:24.500
...broth.

21:24.090 --> 21:25.510
(Broth (figurative))

21:24.500 --> 21:25.220
...broth.

21:25.220 --> 21:26.170
...broth.

21:25.510 --> 21:28.050
(Broth (literal))

21:26.750 --> 21:28.050
Broth?!

21:28.050 --> 21:29.260
Broth...?

21:29.260 --> 21:30.800
R-Right!

21:30.800 --> 21:35.060
Remember how you said you'd let me taste
whatever I wanted during the final round?

21:35.060 --> 21:37.330
You're already ready to eat again?!

21:37.330 --> 21:39.950
Well, a promise is a promise.

21:39.950 --> 21:42.070
You want some soba with broth? Or...

21:51.530 --> 21:53.470
H-Huh...

21:54.130 --> 21:56.000
So that's how you taste.

21:56.600 --> 21:59.280
I-I could get used to it.

21:59.280 --> 22:01.380
Uh, I'm not broth, you know!

22:01.380 --> 22:03.960
I never said you were!

23:36.100 --> 23:38.060
A change occurred in Kurumi.

23:38.470 --> 23:39.480
(Duck Broth)

23:38.470 --> 23:40.730
Every time she heard the word
broth after that,

23:40.730 --> 23:44.540
it made her crave Rentaro's lips.

23:44.540 --> 23:45.980
Wanna stop by for soba?

23:47.550 --> 23:48.490
Yeah.
